{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16048","headline":"原上新居十三首 九 · 王建","name":"原上新居十三首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"和煖遶林行，新贫足喜声。\n埽渠忧竹旱，浇地引兰生。\n山客凭栽树，家僮使入城。\n门前粉壁上，书着县官名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}